evidence[7]{dimension,note}:
  prompt-assets,"Loom 86 agents + 87 commands + 104 protocols + 29 skills (4 registered resource types, contract-driven AgentResult/TOON); gstack skills-only (59 SKILL.md, no protocols/commands dirs). Clear Loom lead."
  architecture,"Honest tie — gstack better-documented centralized runtime core (17-file lib/ + 32KB ARCHITECTURE.md); Loom broader protocol-contract + 82-hook enforcement mesh but thin 6-file lib/ and no ARCHITECTURE.md."
  docs,"Tie at ~8.5 — F-18 drift-proof generated docs landed + docs-drift gate BLOCKING + D-12 hook-count drift resolved; but gstack ships an equivalent blocking multi-host docs gate + broader corpus. Parity, not leapfrog."
  code-quality,"Parity 8=8 — all 6 code-quality defects re-verified fixed (typecheck 0, both shell-injection sites argv-hardened, validator wired, confidence blocks, worktree block gone, cross-repo fix)."
  tests,"TRAILS 7<9 — (1) suite currently RED: committed metrics-snapshot.toon stale (5.88 vs re-derived 5.99), METRICS_MISMATCH fails 2 meta-tests, so nightly full-suite would fail (violates F-14 'suite passes'); (2) raw test:source ratio 1.06 < 1.4 target, reframed as density-equivalence; gstack broader (434 test files, evals/actionlint/windows CI vs Loom ~190)."
  extensibility,"Parity 8=8 — lib/ single-source + CI-BLOCKING C-02 import-ban + converged hook manifest (gstack lacks these); BUT F-08 residual real (42 scripts/ files renameSync, ~11 local atomic-writers, ~6 TOON serializers at warn-tier). Ties, does not exceed."
  ops-polish,"TRAILS 8<9 vs pinned baseline — install.sh fail-CLOSED + version-gate + sigstore/cosign release spine (surpasses gstack's ACTUAL advisory-integrity/zero-tags posture, re-read ~6); held below pinned 9 by 7 lingering legacy plan-exec-* tags + no CHANGELOG.md."
gateResult:
